              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ diaal cikɛ rɔ rialikä kɛ ko̱r, kä cu kɛ ben kä Ɣɛb-ron, kɛ ɣöö ba Dee-bid ben jak kä kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl kɛɛliw. Inɔ bä cua jɛn ca̱r ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl tin kɔ̱ŋ, ɛn ɣöö ba Dee-bid jak kä kuäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛ tey ɛn wi̱ni kɛ Dee-bid kɛɛl kɛ ni̱n diɔ̱k mi̱thkɛ kä mäthkɛ, kɛ mi̱th ti ca lät kä kɛ ɛ cieŋmani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu mäni ji̱ thieekädiɛn tin na̱n ce̱tkɛ ji̱ Yi-tha-kar kɛnɛ ji̱ Dhɛ-bu-lun kɛ ji̱ Nap-ta-li. Cu kɛ mi̱th ti ŋuan nööŋ kɛ jɔk thɔ̱a̱rɔa̱a̱li kɛnɛ muɔ̱li kɛ jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k kɛ thääk. Cua patni buɔ̱ɔ̱ni, kɛ nup, kɛ kɔaŋ, kɛ liɛɛth kɛ ɣɔ̱k kɛ det. Kɛn tɔ̱ diaal tɔ̱tɔ̱ cua kɛ no̱o̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö ter rɛy cieŋ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛɛliw kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
